{"channelId":"UCXzE98giBabtJkRIjTghXTQ","row":["NAT Global Campus",237107,"Welcome to Niel Asher Education's YouTube channel — a trusted global resource for continuing education for massage therapists, continuing education for physical therapists, manual therapists, athletic trainers, and rehabilitation professionals.\n\nOur channel features expert-led tutorials, clinical demonstrations, interviews, and educational insights designed to support professional development and real-world practice. Topics include manual therapy, sports rehabilitation, soft-tissue techniques, movement science, pain management, assessment, and integrative approaches to care.\n\nWhether you are completing continuing education for massage therapists, advancing your skills as a physical or manual therapist, fulfilling continuing education for athletic trainers, or growing as a rehabilitation professional, our content supports lifelong learning and clinical excellence.\n\nNiel Asher Education is known worldwide for high-quality instruction, trusted educators, and accessible online education.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCXzE98giBabtJkRIjTghXTQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCXzE98giBabtJkRIjTghXTQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:02:08.463Z","channelId":"UCXzE98giBabtJkRIjTghXTQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"67e91115a07ee52ea7171ae6421706e10be7782caf3e4c2cd9aa2c2f0e5cd6dc","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"e4dd91788d42fe4e029309bd8294c186866e41ed38042c2db658df69e2c3b2c5"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCXzE98giBabtJkRIjTghXTQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T08:53:15.483Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"facebook","url":"https://www.facebook.com/natglobalcampus","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":237107,"raw":"237,107","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.facebook.com/natglobalcampus/","observedAt":"2026-09-17T05:58:43.218Z"},{"platform":"youtube","url":"h